  "rationale": "SettingsManager.reload is the Go method SettingsManager.Reload; signature reviewed against the upstream declaration.",
  "async": "An awaited Promise is a blocking Go call. Upstream's reload awaits the write queue and then records load errors; PiG writes synchronously (Flush is a no-op), so Reload has nothing to await and records load errors the same way (DrainErrors). No detached goroutine."
